# Release-export attributes.
#
# This file sets no `export-ignore` rule, so `git archive` exports and release
# tarballs contain every tracked file. That includes `.working/TODO.md` and
# `.working/CHANGELOG.md`, which ship as part of the repository.
#
# Working state that is not part of the repository is kept outside it, so no
# rule is needed to keep it out of exports. Add an `export-ignore` line here
# only for a tracked path that must not ship in release tarballs.
